  accept 4863
  turnin 4863                         -- Jaron's Wagon
  accept 4864                         -- Enraged Wildkin, +100
  collect 12525 quest 4864.1          -- Jaron's Supplies
  collect 12524 quest 4864.2          -- Blue-feathered Amulet
  turnin 4864                         -- Jaron Stoneshaper

step Coldridge Valley
  label if-coldridge
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Optional: the Dwarf and Gnome start valley south-west of Kharanos, about 1,100 reputation (220 at a fifth) in 30 minutes at 60. Sten Stoutarm and Balir Frosthammer stand at Anvilmar. In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. Skip this step to skip the hub.
